# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
#
# Plain-Arch stand-ins for luminos-base and luminos-desktop, which don't
# exist yet (SPEC.md's "Changes outside Dawn"; see DECISIONS.md). The
# local mirror carries exactly this list (setup-local-mirror.sh), and the
# test ISO's installer.toml names it as the packages to install, so
# online e2e installs pacstrap it from that mirror. The test ISO includes
# it too (build-test-iso.sh), the way the real ISO is built from the same
# meta-packages, so an offline install unsquashes the same set. Swap in
# the real meta-packages once luminos-repository exists.
#
# archiso's packages.x86_64 format: one package per line, comments on
# their own lines.

base
linux
mkinitcpio
# fsck.btrfs: mkinitcpio's fsck hook needs it for a btrfs root, and
# step 9's `mkinitcpio -P` fails without it.
btrfs-progs
# Step 12 enables their services.
networkmanager
greetd
# Step 8's sudoers drop-in.
sudo
# Step 7's zram config.
zram-generator
